<title>USA: Interlake completes ARC Metals purchase.</title>
<headline>Interlake completes ARC Metals purchase.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interlake Corp said Friday it completed the purchase of the assets of ARC Metals Inc through Interlake's Hoeganaes Corporation subsidiary.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not announced.</p>
<p>ARC Metals specializes in custom blending and recycling of ferrous metal powders as a service to the metal powders industry.</p>
<p>Interlake designs and makes products for the material handling, automotive and aerospace industries.</p>
<p>Its shares closed unchanged Friday at 4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
